---
import { gh, REPO } from "./format";
---
<footer class="colophon">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div class="c-a">
      <p class="sign">The Intention Gap</p>
      <p>
        I developed The Intention Gap as an independent research project. I defined the question, selected the datasets, directed methodological
        decisions, and reviewed the findings and limitations before approving the scientific results. I used ChatGPT for technical exploration and
        Claude Code for development assistance, including substantial Python and website implementation, tests, verification tools and documentation.
        <a href={gh("docs/technical_walkthrough.md")}>My research and development process</a>.
      </p>
      <p>Not peer-reviewed. Research frozen in November 2026.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="c-b">
      <span class="label">Data notices</span>
      <ul>
        <li>Human Fertility Database, Max Planck Institute for Demographic Research and Vienna Institute of Demography (www.humanfertility.org; USA release 2 July 2026, downloaded 20 November 2026). Licensed <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>; changed by this project. The HFD does not endorse this project.</li>
        <li>Data Source: National Center for Health Statistics, National Survey of Family Growth, 2022-2023; natality data from CDC/NCHS. Analyses and conclusions are the author's; NCHS is responsible only for the initial data release.</li>
        <li>This product uses the Census Bureau Data API but is not endorsed or certified by the Census Bureau.</li>
        <li>NLSY97 public-use data, Bureau of Labor Statistics. The project is not affiliated with or endorsed by the BLS.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="c-c">
      <span class="label">Licences and credits</span>
      <ul>
        <li>Project code: <a href={gh("LICENSE")}>MIT License</a>. Research writing and presentation: <a href={gh("LICENSE-docs.md")}>CC BY 4.0</a>. Third-party data keep their own terms.</li>
        <li>Photographs: <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/string_bass_dave/51729207037/">David Brossard, <em>July Evening in Washington Square</em></a> (<a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/">CC BY-SA 2.0</a>, resized) and <a href="https://www.loc.gov/item/2010641825/">Carol M. Highsmith, Shepherd Street row houses</a>, George F. Landegger Collection, Library of Congress, Prints and Photographs Division (no known publication restrictions).</li>
        <li>Map: U.S. Census Bureau cartographic boundaries via us-atlas. Type: Source Serif 4 and IBM Plex (SIL Open Font License). Built with Astro, D3 and GSAP.</li>
        <li><a href={REPO}>Repository</a> · <a href={gh("docs/licensing_and_attribution.md")}>Full licensing and attribution</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
